.com/wp/media/australia_penny_lane_ep-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/australia_penny_lane_ep-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/australia_penny_lane_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/australia_penny_lane_ep.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9116\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/australia_penny_lane_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/australia_penny_lane_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,1000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Penny Lane EP artwork \u2013 Australia\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/australia_penny_lane_ep-960x960.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_penny_lane/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Penny Lane/Strawberry Fields Forever single artwork - Brazil\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane-960x946.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane-768x756.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9190\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_penny_lane/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,985\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Penny Lane/Strawberry Fields Forever single artwork \u2013 Brazil\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_penny_lane-960x946.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/italy_penny_lane/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Penny Lane/Strawberry Fields Forever single artwork - Italy\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane-960x946.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane-768x756.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9529\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/italy_penny_lane/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,985\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Penny Lane/Strawberry Fields Forever single artwork \u2013 Italy\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/italy_penny_lane-960x946.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_penny_lane_ep/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Penny Lane EP artwork - Denmark, Sweden\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep-580x575.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep-960x952.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep-768x762.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10141\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_penny_lane_ep/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,992\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Penny Lane EP artwork \u2013 Denmark, Sweden\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_penny_lane_ep-960x952.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><blockquote><div>The only reason that \u2018Strawberry Fields Forever\u2019 and &#8216;Penny Lane&#8217; didn&#8217;t go onto the new album was a feeling that if we issued a single, it shouldn&#8217;t go onto an album. That was a crazy idea, and I&#8217;m afraid I was partly responsible. It&#8217;s nonsense these days, but in those days it was an aspect that we&#8217;d try to give the public value for money.</p><p>The idea of a double a-side came from me and <a href=\"/people/brian-epstein/\">Brian</a>, really. Brian was desperate to recover popularity, and so we wanted to make sure that we had a marvellous seller. He came to me and said, &#8216;I must have a really great single. What have you got?&#8217; I said, &#8216;Well, I&#8217;ve got three tracks \u2013 and two of them are the best tracks they&#8217;ve ever made. We could put the two together and make a smashing single.&#8217; We did, and it was a smashing single \u2013 but it was also a dreadful mistake. We would have sold far more and got higher up the charts if we had issued one of those with, say, <a href=\"/songs/when-im-sixty-four/\">&#8216;When I&#8217;m Sixty-Four&#8217;</a> on the back.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><p>Remarkably, although it was arguably The Beatles&#8217; strongest single, it failed to top the UK singles chart. Although sales were on a par with other Beatles singles, and it received much airplay across radio stations, it was held off by Engelbert Humperdinck&#8217;s \u2018Release Me\u2019. It did, however, top the charts in the US and most other countries in which it was issued.</p><blockquote><div>It was pretty bad, wasn&#8217;t it, that Engelbert Humperdinck stopped \u2018Strawberry Fields Forever\u2019 from getting to number one? But I don&#8217;t think it was a worry. At first, we wanted to have good chart positions, but then I think we started taking it for granted. It might have been a bit of a shock being number two \u2013 but then again, there were always so many different charts that you could be number two in one chart and number one in another.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><p>Several versions of &#8216;Penny Lane&#8217; were included in the 2017 deluxe reissue of <a href=\"/albums/sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band/\"><em>Sgt Pepper</em></a>. They were: Take six (instrumental); vocal overdubs and speech, containing suggestions for the brass parts; a new stereo mix; the original mono mix; and the Capitol Records mono US promo mix.</p><div class=\"fab-forum-link\"><a href=\"/fab-forum/the-songs/penny-lane/\">Discuss &#8216;Penny Lane&#8217; on the Fab Forum \u00bb</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation\"><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-pre\"> <strong>Previous song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/strawberry-fields-forever/\">&#8216;Strawberry Fields Forever&#8217;</a></div><div class=\"wp-post-navigation-next\"> <strong>Next song:</strong> <a href=\"/songs/baby-youre-a-rich-man/\">&#8216;Baby You&#8217;re A Rich Man&#8217;</a></div></div><div align=\"center\" style=\"clear:both;margin:15px 0;\"></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/penny-lane/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span></div>",
